  <p id="c-jiutangshu-093-tang93:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jiutangshu-093-tang93:p001:m0000" ref="eh3_286_jdo">王晙</persName>，滄州景城人，徙家於洛陽。祖有方，岷州刺史。<persName id="c-jiutangshu-093-tang93:p001:m0024" ref="eh3_286_jdo">晙</persName>弱冠明經擢第，曆遷殿中侍御史，加朝散大夫。</p>
